        Position: {x: 948.56256, y: -261.36188}
        ID:
          m_Value0: 2388333333544758520
          m_Value1: 13556770210671419374
        Parents: []
        PortModels: []
        Text: "WHAT EACH ABORT MODE DOES (SUMMARY)\n\n- NONE -\nCondition only checked
          once on entry\n\u274C Almost never correct for combat AI.\n\n- SELF -\nRe-evaluates
          while its own branch is running.\nGood for:\n\"Stay stunned while stunned\"\n\"Stop
          attack if condition becomes false\"\n\n- LOWER PRIORITY -\nIf this condition
          becomes true, it aborts branches below it.\nGood for:\nInterrupting Chase
          when Attack becomes valid\n\n- BOTH - \nSelf + Lower Priority.\n\u2705
          BEST DEFAULT for COMBAT LOGIC. "
    - rid: 7112529932022710471
      type: {class: StickyNoteModel, ns: Unity.Behavior.GraphFramework, asm: Unity.Behavior.GraphFramework}
      data:
        Position: {x: 1326.0172, y: -84.69361}
        ID:
          m_Value0: 12797059738109234887
          m_Value1: 9930070030627737712
        Parents: []
        PortModels: []
        Text: "For:\n- IsDead\n- IsStunned\n- ShouldLunge\n- InSwingRange\n- CanSwing\n-
          CanLunge\n\nSet them to BOTH \n(The Abort Mode for Conditional Guards OR
          Abort nodes)"
    - rid: 7112529932407013988
      type: {class: ActionNodeModel, ns: Unity.Behavior, asm: Unity.Behavior.Authoring}
